## Common Issues
- **Artifact not found**: ensure both `github-token` and `run-id` are set on `download-artifact@v4`
- **Permission denied creating release**: workflow needs `permissions: contents: write`
- **Image not found**: confirm Build & Publish completed on main (look at the Actions tab)
- **Composition not registered**: if a new composition was added, update the `composition_id` choice options in `render-video.yml`
